<title>USA: Sioux City cattle $1.00 higher - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux City cattle $1.00 higher - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX CITY 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade moderately active. Compared to last Monday, slaughter steers and heifers $1.00 higher. - USDA</p>
<p>Slaughter Steers:  Choice 2-3, drug free 1325 lbs 64.50. Choice 2-3, 1100-1375 lbs 63.50-64.25.  Select and Choice 2-3, 1050-1250 lbs 62.50-63.50.</p>
<p>Slaughter Heifers:  Choice 2-3, drug free 1260 lbs 64.60. Select and Choice  2-3, 1025-1225 lbs 62.50-63.25.</p>
</text>
